      "content": "i'm curious about that \"faithful portrayal\" part though. if the goal was to critique colonialism, couldn't he have done that without using such dehumanizing language? it feels like if you're just using the same slurs and tropes as the colonizers, you're almost just reinforcing them for the reader. isn't there a risk that by calling it \"faithful,\" we're just making excuses for the racism in the text?",
